    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affiliated Homies is a casual high-stakes multiplayer game where trust is a luxury you can't afford. Set in chaotic environments, players are thrusted into a deadly game of cat and mouse, where the line between friend and foe is  blurred! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Factions, One Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Affiliated, a group of criminals determined to protect their stolen goods, or play as an undercover cop on a  mission to recover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Multiplayer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced gameplay with friends or players around the world. Each round brings a fresh wave of tension as you navigate the crowded scenario, trying to identify and eliminate your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absurd Recoil Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge of Affiliated Homies banana recoil system. Every shot counts, but managing your weapon\u2019s kickback will be the worst for players. Mastering your recoil control could be the difference between win and lose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close-Quarters Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is up close and personal, where you'll need quick reflexes to stay alive. Expect no mercy in these tight, claustrophobic spaces, where every corner could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy! &lt;3</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affiliated Homies is a casual high-stakes multiplayer game where trust is a luxury you can't afford. Set in chaotic environments, players are thrusted into a deadly game of cat and mouse, where the line between friend and foe is  blurred! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Factions, One Mission</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Affiliated, a group of criminals determined to protect their stolen goods, or play as an undercover cop on a  mission to recover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Multiplayer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced gameplay with friends or players around the world. Each round brings a fresh wave of tension as you navigate the crowded scenario, trying to identify and eliminate your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absurd Recoil Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the challenge of Affiliated Homies banana recoil system. Every shot counts, but managing your weapon\u2019s kickback will be the worst for players. Mastering your recoil control could be the difference between win and lose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Close-Quarters Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is up close and personal, where you'll need quick reflexes to stay alive. Expect no mercy in these tight, claustrophobic spaces, where every corner could be your last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy! &lt;3</p>",
